{"unit_id":"Zouu-X__DSH_WebNotification#card-zh","repo":"Zouu-X/DSH_WebNotification","commit":"f308cfc9ab82422be766a157ce0acdb0e1572432","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的会话完成通知插件。它通过浏览器客户端注入 sessions 服务，监听会话运行状态，并在运行中的会话转为空闲时显示系统通知。通知仅在用户切换到其他标签页、窗口失去焦点或完成任务的会话不是当前选中会话时触发；通知标题使用会话名称，并按会话标记以替换重复通知。插件会在首次点击或键盘操作时请求浏览器通知权限，没有按钮、设置界面或主机端功能。适合希望切换窗口后及时获知 DSH 任务完成的网页端用户；需要启用浏览器通知权限，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:12-19","src/client/index.ts:12-26","src/client/watcher.ts:35-59","src/client/notifier.ts:18-75"]}
{"unit_id":"Zouu-X__DSH_WebNotification#card-en","repo":"Zouu-X/DSH_WebNotification","commit":"f308cfc9ab82422be766a157ce0acdb0e1572432","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify alerts DeepSeek Harness web users when a session becomes idle while they are away or viewing another session. It uses the session title and replaces repeat alerts. Permission is requested on first interaction. Requires browser notification permission; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:12-19","src/client/index.ts:12-26","src/client/watcher.ts:35-59","src/client/notifier.ts:18-75"]}
