{"unit_id":"Zouu-X__DSH_WebNotification#feature-1","repo":"Zouu-X/DSH_WebNotification","commit":"f308cfc9ab82422be766a157ce0acdb0e1572432","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「会话完成提醒」：监听 DSH 会话的运行状态，在 running 转为 idle 时检查用户是否正查看该会话；用户离开页面或当前选中其他会话时，浏览器显示带会话名称的系统通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/watcher.ts:35-59","src/client/notifier.ts:18-24"]}
