{"unit_id":"Zouu-X__DSH_WebNotification#feature-3","repo":"Zouu-X/DSH_WebNotification","commit":"f308cfc9ab82422be766a157ce0acdb0e1572432","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「按会话替换通知」：每条系统通知使用会话 ID 作为 tag，同一会话后续通知会替换已有通知，而不会重复堆叠。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/notifier.ts:18-24"]}
